IMPORTANT — THE APACHE LICENSE COVERS THIS SOFTWARE, NOT THE DATA IT RETRIEVES
==============================================================================

This software is a gateway. It stores no ESG ratings and redistributes none;
it fetches them live from the data holders' own services on each request.

The ESG ratings reachable through it are the copyrighted works of the rating
agencies, and each agency sets its own terms. As confirmed on 2026-09-08 at
https://esg.krx.co.kr :

  KCGS, MSCI                       "for internal use only"
  Sustinvest, S&P Global           no reproduction in any form without
                                   prior written permission
  Korea ESG Research Institute     no reproduction, transmission, quotation
                                   or distribution without prior written consent

None of the five permit public disclosure. Corporate filings retrieved through
KIND belong to the companies that filed them. Greenhouse-gas figures come from
GIR's published statement data under that agency's terms.

The Apache License granted above gives you no rights whatsoever in any of that
data. Being permitted to use, modify and sell this software commercially is not
permission to collect, store, republish or resell the ratings it reads. If you
intend to expose this as a public service or build a commercial product on the
ratings themselves, ask each agency first.

Every response this software returns carries the issuing agency's notice and a
link to its original terms in a `license` field. Do not strip it.


